<<set _robin to statusCheck("Robin")>>
<<run ensureRobinStand()>>
<<set _handled to $robinStand.skill gte 400 or C.npc.Robin.dom gte 60>>
You stay where you are and let Robin deal with it.
<br><br>
<<if _handled>>
	Robin takes the cup, fills it, and places it on the counter. When the customer reaches for it, <<he>> repeats the price and waits without giving the cup back.
	<br><br>
	The <<person2>><<person>> waits a few seconds, then puts the money down. Robin lets <<him>> take the cup.
	<<set $robinmoney += $robinStandVenue is "park" ? 2 : 1>>
	<br><br>
	<<endevent>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
