	<<run V.robinStand.skill = Math.min(ensureRobinStand().skill + 20, 1000)>>
<<else>>
	Robin says sorry and refills the cup. The <<person2>><<person>> takes it and starts to leave without paying, but Robin does not stop <<him>>. <<He>> apologises again instead.
	<br><br>
	Two people waiting behind the customer see what happened. They ask for free refills too, and Robin fills their cups without asking for money.
	<br><br>
	<<endevent>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
	"I know," Robin says before you can speak. <<He>> keeps looking down at the counter. "I know. I should have told them no."
	<<npcincr Robin dom -1>><<ldom>><<npcincr Robin trauma 1>>
