:: Robin Stand Spill Buy
<<endevent>>
<<robinStandLocation $robinStandVenue>><<effects>>
<<set _robin to statusCheck("Robin")>>
<<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<speechresolve>>
<<switch _speechAttitudeResolved>>
	<<case "meek">>
		"I-I can get more ingredients," you say. "You can keep selling what's left."
	<<case "shy">>
		"I can go and buy more ingredients," you offer. "D-do you think you can keep serving until I get back?"
	<<case "polite">>
		"Please keep the stand open," you say. "I'll buy the ingredients you need."
	<<case "confident">>
		"You keep serving," you say. "I'll get the ingredients and bring them back."
	<<case "bratty">>
		"Don't close over one spill," you say. "Keep selling drinks. I'll get more supplies."
	<<case "docile">>
		"I'll buy more ingredients for you," you say. "You can keep serving the customers."
	<<case "flamboyant">>
		"Please keep the stand open," you say. "I'll buy the ingredients you need."
	<<case "cruel">>
		"Don't let one accident stop you," you say. "Keep the stand open while I get more supplies."
	<<default>>
		"Keep serving what you have," you say. "I'll go and buy more ingredients."
<</switch>>
<br><br>
You leave Robin to serve the remaining drinks while you go and buy the ingredients <<he>> needs.
<<if $robinStandVenue is "park">>
	When you return with milk, cocoa, and a bag of sugar, people are still waiting at the stand.
<<else>>
	When you return with a crate of lemons and two bags of sugar, people are still waiting at the stand.
<</if>>
You put everything down beside Robin so <<he>> can start making more drinks.
<br><br>
<<if _robin.trauma gte 40>>
	Robin takes the bags from you and starts putting the ingredients away. For the rest of the afternoon, <<he>> keeps working beside you instead of moving to the other end of the stand.
	<<ltrauma>><<trauma -4>>
<<else>>
	"You didn't have to do that," Robin says while unpacking the bags. "I'm writing down what it cost. I'm paying you back."
	When you object, <<he>> shakes <<his>> head and writes the amount down anyway.
<</if>>
<<npcincr Robin love 2>><<npcincr Robin dom -1>><<glove>><<ldom>>
<<set $robinmoney += 20>>
<br><br>
<<robinStandOptions $robinStandVenue>>

:: Robin Stand Spill Help
<<endevent>>
<<robinStandLocation $robinStandVenue>><<effects>>
<<set _robin to statusCheck("Robin")>>
<<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<run ensureRobinStand()>>
<<set _housekeeping to currentSkillValue("housekeeping")>>
<<speechresolve>>
<<switch _speechAttitudeResolved>>
	<<case "meek">>
		"I-I'll help you make more," you say, moving behind the counter beside Robin.
	<<case "shy">>
		"Could I help?" you ask, stepping behind the counter. "W-we can make another batch together."
	<<case "polite">>
		"Let me help you make another batch," you say. "Could you move over a little?"
	<<case "confident">>
		"We can still serve everyone," you say, stepping beside Robin. "Let's make another batch."
	<<case "bratty">>
		"Come on, Robin," you say, stepping behind the counter. "We can fix this. Let's start mixing."
	<<case "docile">>
		"I'll make another batch with you," you say, taking a place beside Robin behind the counter.
	<<case "flamboyant">>
		"Let me help you make another batch," you say. "Could you move over a little?"
	<<case "cruel">>
		"We're not letting one spill ruin the day," you say, joining Robin behind the counter. "Let's make another batch."
	<<default>>
		"I'll help," you say, moving behind the counter. "Let's make another batch."
<</switch>>
<br><br>
<<if _housekeeping gte 600>>
	You measure the ingredients while Robin prepares the cups, then speak to the waiting customers whenever <<he>> needs both hands. The new batch is ready before anyone leaves the queue.
	<<set _recovered to 15>>
	<<run V.robinStand.skill = Math.min(V.robinStand.skill + 15, 1000)>>
<<elseif _housekeeping gte 300>>
	You measure while Robin mixes, stopping twice to correct the amounts. A few customers leave while you work, but most stay until the new batch is ready.
	<<set _recovered to 8>>
	<<run V.robinStand.skill = Math.min(V.robinStand.skill + 10, 1000)>>
<<else>>
	You measure the ingredients twice after getting the amounts wrong, while Robin tries to keep the remaining customers waiting. Most of the queue leaves before the new batch is ready to serve.
	<<set _recovered to 3>>
	<<run V.robinStand.skill = Math.min(V.robinStand.skill + 5, 1000)>>
<</if>>
<<set $robinmoney += _recovered>>
<br><br>
<<if _robin.trauma gte 40>>
	"I thought we'd have to close for the day," Robin says. <<He>> holds your sleeve while looking at the fresh batch.
<<else>>
	"Two people make this so much faster," Robin says, wiping <<his>> forehead with <<his>> sleeve. "I didn't know we could recover that quickly."
<</if>>
<<npcincr Robin love 1>><<glove>><<ltrauma>><<lstress>><<trauma -2>><<stress -6>>
<br><br>
<<robinStandOptions $robinStandVenue>>

:: Robin Stand Spill Sell
